WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.728
Welcome to the Digital Confidence Centre, built for people like you.

00:00:04.728 --> 00:00:12.456
Short lessons on scams, banking, passwords, video calls, telehealth and artificial intelligence.

00:00:12.456 --> 00:00:19.536
This is the adult version, not the one for younger people. That one is nearly ready.

00:00:19.536 --> 00:00:24.768
Thank you for joining the pilot group. Explore freely.

00:00:24.768 --> 00:00:31.944
If something is not clear, tell us. There is a Give feedback link on every page.

00:00:31.944 --> 00:00:39.888
We only ask for your email if you want us to remember your place. Optional, and never required.

00:00:39.888 --> 00:00:41.928
Take your time.
